          "en": "Appointment of a Competent Person will be either by the issue of a HV Competent Person Certificate in which case they are deemed competent to enter a HV area without the issue of a Limitation of Access or by the issue of a Safety Document in which case they must be deemed competent for the task to be performed by the Senior Authorised Persons prior to the issue of the Safety document.",
