          "en": "In an emergency High Voltage Switchgear in service may be switched off or tripped off by any person. If they believe they are reducing the danger. That person, without delay and with some urgency, is to advise the Duty Authorised Person of the action taken. In normal circumstances High Voltage Switchgear is to be operated only by:",
