          "en": "When tests are to be applied to High Voltage Equipment, a Sanction for Test is to be issued to the Competent Person who is to be present throughout the duration of the tests. If a voltage greater than low voltage will be present, the areas containing exposed live conductors, test equipment and any High Voltage test connection are to be regarded as High Voltage Enclosures. Unauthorised access to a High Voltage Enclosure is to be prevented by, as a minimum, red and white striped tape, not less than 25mm wide, suspended on posts, and by the display of Danger Signs. A Safety Person is to be present throughout the duration of the tests, and the area is to be continually watched while testing is in progress.",
          "zh": "對高壓設備進行測試時，須向適任人員（CP）簽發測試許可（SFT），該人員須在整個測試期間在場。如將出現高於低壓範圍的電壓，包含裸露帶電導體、測試設備及任何高壓測試接線的區域，均須視為高壓圍隔區（High Voltage Enclosure）。為防止未經授權者進入高壓圍隔區，至少須使用寬度不小於 25mm、懸掛於支柱上的紅白相間條紋警戒帶，並設置危險標示。安全人員須在整個測試期間在場，測試進行中須持續監視該區域。",
