          "en": "High Voltage Potential Indicators and Proving Units should comply with Electricity Association Engineering Recommendation G9/6 -Voltage Testing Devices. Extension rods, end adaptors, and other fittings should be available to suit the equipment on which work is to be undertaken.",
          "zh": "高壓驗電器及驗證裝置應符合電力協會工程建議 G9/6——電壓測試裝置。應備有適合預定工作設備的延長桿、端部轉接件及其他配件。",
